{"version":2,"text":"4.\n\nThis policy document states that nurses\n\nA\n\nmust sign a paper form if they want any new stock.\n\nB\n\ncan order medicines from the pharmacy in some cases.\n\nC\n\nshould speak to the pharmacist if a drug is needed urgently.\n\nE\nL\n\nStock requisitioning\n\nIf stock levels of a medicine are low, the nurse should firstly liaise directly with their ward-based team to\n\narrange urgent stock replenishment. If the ward-based team is unavailable, the nurse should complete\n\na request form online and email it to the pharmacy stores. Paper-based ordering systems are available\n\nP\nM\n\n(e.g. the ward medicines requisition book); however these should not be relied on if ward stock is urgently\n\nneeded.\n\n“At risk medicines” – Diazepam/Codeine Phosphate/Co-codamol – may only be ordered for stock when\n\na paper requisition is written. Paper-based requisitions should be complete, legible and signed, and then\n\nA\nS\n\nsent to the pharmacy department.\n\nWards/clinical areas using Mediwell 365 cabinets will have orders transmitted automatically to Pharmacy\n\non a daily basis, as stock is used.\n\nSAMPLE\n\n[CANDIDATE NO.] READING QUESTION PAPER PARTS B & C 05/16\n\nPage 561","layout":{"version":1,"width":595.276001,"height":841.890015,"blocks":[{"text":"4.","lines":[{"text":"4.","x":0.10195758252985576,"y":0.08884928157747542,"width":0.014010307800061994,"height":0.01655798233929642,"confidence":1,"words":[{"text":"4.","x":0.10195758252985576,"width":0.014010307800061994,"confidence":1}]}]},{"text":"This policy document states that nurses","lines":[{"text":"This policy document states that nurses","x":0.14958254969193693,"y":0.08899181801081227,"width":0.29503961138188073,"height":0.015809666064278007,"confidence":1,"words":[{"text":"This","x":0.14958254969193693,"width":0.03173317917783822,"confidence":1},{"text":"policy","x":0.18598583146979583,"width":0.042938065631844595,"confidence":1},{"text":"document","x":0.2335939997016611,"width